{
 "meta": {
  "bibkey": "marty-etal-2026",
  "method": "experiment",
  "description": "Two picture-verification experiments on presupposition projection from the scope of 'each', 'none' and 'exactly one' (the last with a positive and a negated scope), over a domain of four children named and pictured. Experiment 1 tests the existence presupposition of 'the present in front of him' (74 participants after exclusions), Experiment 2 the gender presupposition of 'her' (71). Each target sentence was paired with four picture types, each instantiated four times with the children's positions varied, and judged 'Good' or 'Bad'. Figure 1 plots the proportion of 'Good' responses per sentence and picture type, recorded here as counts recomputed from the released trials; the text reports some of them as rounded percentages.",
  "rawData": [
   {
    "url": "https://osf.io/46vef",
    "doc": "trial-level data, condition means and analysis output of both experiments (§3.4); the pictures and counts are recomputed from processed_data_existence.csv and processed_data_gender.csv, which already apply the exclusions of §3.5"
   }
  ]
 },
